# Docker Sandbox — workshop-app

This workspace is the **Next.js playground** synced into a [Docker Sandbox](https://docs.docker.com/ai/sandboxes/) microVM.

## Split with platform

| App | Role |
|-----|------|
| **workshop-app** (this repo) | Playground UI — home, about, quick start — runs in sbx |
| **Hosted platform** | Register, login, labs, progress, Q&A — https://nextjs-26f1-3000.prg1.zerops.app |

Auth and Supabase live on the **platform**, not here. Use `redirectToPlatform()` / `platformUrl()` from `src/lib/platform.ts`.

## sbx quick reference

```bash
sbx ls
cd workshop-app && sbx run cursor . --kit ../customize/kit/workshop-app-nextjs --name lab5-kit
sbx run --clone cursor . --name lab4-clone    # from monorepo root
sbx policy deny network "host"
sbx secret set -g cursor
sbx rm NAME
```

## Security

- Never commit API keys or `.env.local`
- Use `sbx secret set -g cursor` on the host (Lab 1); `sbx secret set -g github` (Lab 3)
- Do not disable network deny rules in lab examples

Docs: https://docs.docker.com/ai/sandboxes/
